{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":432,"result_hash":"sha256:881a7ffa9b72d49f2b7f6941751f37c28227088a1dfe1f4bb90945629b997e5a","result_inline":"README.md\nslugify\n\nvendor/slugify:\nCHANGELOG.md\nindex.ts\n# docsite-pages\n\nPage model for the documentation site. `pageSlug(title)` turns a page title into the URL segment; slugs are lowercase, hyphen separated and ASCII, and existing URLs must keep resolving.\n\nThird-party code lives under `vendor/` as exact copies of upstream releases (see `vendor/README.md`); `vendor/slugify` was bumped to 2.0.0 last week.\n\nNode 24, `npm test`.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:fe8a597f1aa9405ac9e26b7d12432304a9682a23d059576f4daa36943c3da4ec","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:d478caad4e462915dcefa1842ea8063c7150fb4fcacdcb88e6a4494b6a51ce81","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"aa64b3e3-e572-48a8-b845-0ba21f780a89","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
