{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":15,"result_bytes":753,"result_hash":"sha256:3c8f7d323fab0a7fa2f9744ace46b89feb6e02f9e76084beaea93d8f2c313c12","result_inline":"# slugify changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking:\n- `slugify(text, separator)` is now `slugify(text, options)`. Passing a string as the second argument is no longer supported.\n- Lowercasing is opt-in: pass `{ lower: true }`. 1.x always lowercased.\n- The default separator is `_` (was `-`).\n\nAdded:\n- `strict: true` drops every character that is not a letter or a digit instead of turning runs of them into a separator.\n\n## 1.4.2\n\n- Combining marks are stripped after NFKD normalisation, so accented letters become their base letter.\n# vendor\n\nExact copies of upstream releases, one directory per package, with the upstream CHANGELOG. Update by re-vendoring the next release; never patch a vendored file in place, the next re-vendor would silently drop the patch.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:ac30b64ef61958904f81ac99e428559de139290c887535e2792b4aa6ee8faba0","mono_ns":16000000,"prev":"sha256:314718cf1b487b65d4608f2a0382d10a3211683f16db20475627b12c5151a3ca","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":16,"session":"aa64b3e3-e572-48a8-b845-0ba21f780a89","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.016Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
